queue, it must have a non-empty title, text, and price. By using value objects alone, we
cannot guarantee that our entity state is correct as a whole. The entity state validity can
change depending on what state the entity has at a particular moment of its life cycle. Only
when a given command is being executed, we need to check if these constraints are
